  "description": "Eat up the miles with a bike that anticipates your every move. The trail-hungry Shift R9 LT knows what you want: big days on sweet singletrack. Push your limits, but not your bike, on a top-of-the-line 140mm travel Rockshox suspension platform spec'd with the best balance of strong and light high-end components.\nNew Shift R LT 6061-T6 alloy 4-Bar linkage frame, 140mm rear travel, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12mm thru-axle dropouts\nInternal cable routing\nRockShox Monarch RL DebonAir rear shock w/ rebound adjuster and lockout\nNew RockShox Revelation RL fork, taper steerer, 140mm travel; 15x100mm thru-axle w/ Maxle Stealth axle & remote lockout\nNew Praxis Cadet forged crankset w/ 32T alloy chainring\nShimano XT GS 11-spd Shadow Plus rear derailleur\nShimano XT 1x11-spd right shifter & 11-42 cassette\nWTB STP i25 double wall rims\nKenda Nevegal X 27.5x2.35 120tpi tires, Aramid beads\nRitchey Trail alloy cockpit w/ Trail WCS Lock-Ring grips\nNew Shimano SLX 7000 Hydraulic disc brakes\nUpper chain guide",
